Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm completely out of cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the world's gone all blurry\Nfrom the lack of nicotine in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Yaniko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the cigarette fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When Beast Folk are in need, I arrive to\Nsave them from the chains of nicotine…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know a thing in heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.02,0:00:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I need a bath reason number\N215 for why I hate Beast Folk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Friendly tip, Chainsmoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you're having\Na nicotine overdose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting the enjoy responsibly\Nin moderation part of smoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I'm doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I must say, you sound completely\Nresponsible and in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem we've reached an impasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, I shall bestow upon you the\Nsacred nicotine receptor exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, dokoi dokoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.84,0:01:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dokoi dokoi dokoi dokoi se!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think? Is it working?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give it to the diggity!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fault for shaking that toasty little\Nbooty in my face, so don't run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit, I can't taste this cigarette!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm just in your...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.89,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh newsletter after all of nothing\Nmore than a figment of your imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:01:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaniko
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right we can't be I can\Nfeel you right here with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.60,0:02:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so it's nothing more than an\Nillusion created by your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.74,0:02:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The smell of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.96,0:02:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The feeling of hemp. A\Nsunset reflecting off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the land and the distant\Nwhistle of a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.42,0:02:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.72,0:02:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be together forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's do that exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YAAAAYYYY!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yaku Neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running crazy, you know what you\Ncan see and let me put my smoke off you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but if you're looking\Nfor cigs, I'm fresh out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar, you're smoking one right now! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that not a hand-rolled cig?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.37,0:05:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.38,0:05:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've treated you to plenty of my\Ncigarette butts back when you were broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, talk about an ungrateful\Nlittle junior. But that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn, that shit's dank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, Senpai, if you're gonna hit it,\Nyou gotta hold that shit in for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise you're wasting\Nthe good stuff, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a cigarette? Sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some good stuff\Nyou got here, Yaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.98,0:05:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gas, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai, let's get some ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes great if you eat it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that time of the year already?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I hate how the meds\Nalways taste like yenshin tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaku, mind if I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, hey, sup, howdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to take my mad beast prevention\Nmeds, but I didn't have any water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The utilities cut me off\Nagain for not paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I just took my meds too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.30,0:06:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're shooting\Nup any weird drugs again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not doing drugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm clean now and you\Nfucking know it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goddammit, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.08,0:07:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe me,\Nthen who the fuck will?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be all alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I could just live like everybody\Nelse if I finally just got clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, real fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick question for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You care a lot about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.24,0:07:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.07,0:07:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fucking narc, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You good-skies piggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give me back my\Nsenpai, you fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cops like you are the reason\Nmy life's gone to shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So just show your true colors already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but man, that show is funny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:08:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew we could drink that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast Folk, spare a moment of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the bar owner\Nwas fucking crazy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.60,0:08:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I didn't think he'd\Nflash his ass like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be worth your while. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking for excitement?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.76,0:08:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a palm reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn, that's pricey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.04,0:08:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do one for 100 yen, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll consider it for the chance to\Nwipe those cocky grins off your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.12,0:08:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.10,0:08:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you see my truth, by the end of\Nthe reading, I want full payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.12,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's fine by me. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget fortune-telling and tell\Nyou how to wash your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.48,0:08:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A smoker, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're severely addicted,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and your family longs to free\Nyou from this nicotine curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.74,0:08:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're a stranger to\Nmoney, so you live alone in a slum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:08:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,lung cancer will take you in five years,\Nor you'll burn alive from smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Poet-senpai, she's\Njust a creepy old lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, take a big tasty puff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Appears I was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you're next, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid, I'll do yours\Nfor 100 yen. Huh? Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All this kind of oogie-boogie\Nstuff is a hard no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.48,0:09:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mystic mumbo-jumbo is\Nbased on the Barnum effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just open your\Neyes and look around you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,it's easy to guess stuff about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.62,0:09:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you currently taking\Nany illegal drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do you have a criminal record?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,House has never been searched?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you being truthful?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.86,0:09:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew my palm had such a big mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.80,0:10:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, not like I did\Nanything wrong, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You get to decide whether\Nyou believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you like what you heard, just leave\Na hundred yen and be on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai, don't you need to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything has its time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My part-time job pays\Nat the end of each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to come with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that, Cloud?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.64,0:11:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.32,0:11:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.86,0:11:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A being of freedom, not bound by\Nthe crudities of our mortal realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.50,0:11:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of me that I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Something as banal as hunger will never\Ntake away that freedom from me. That!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Buddha, monk, and\NStoic sage all wrapped in one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess even a cloud could get\Nmoving if they ran out of cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I'll consider\Nyour offer. Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Today's senpai brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes me think of when\Nwe first met and how cool
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:12:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you were that's right\Nyou were as cool as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloud in the sky and\Nthere was nothing in the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,world that could hold\Nyou down i loved that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're in there,\NYakuza. Open the fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,up already help me get a job god damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you're not asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not be on any\Nfucking drugs, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.48,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up and open the door! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.67,0:12:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really, really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I thought I had a carton,\Nbut I smoked it last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I need money to buy cigarettes ASAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me get a job so I can\Nstart a campaign right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm living in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not a cloud in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a cloud of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This game sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Netto, this game\Nfucking sucks. Come on, Yani.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.22,0:13:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lesson number one with fighting\Ngames is you don't lose your temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Emotions get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta channel it in a focus, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.36,0:13:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could do that, I wouldn't be\Nsuffering like this. It's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.72,0:13:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you how to\Nplay ranked mode matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got Ultimate Master Rank on this\Ngame and I can show you how I did it.
