Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.47,0:21:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,wonder what language that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't put any drawings\Nor symbols into the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.30,0:21:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,system Oh, I think I got it.
