Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How about anal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll do a surprise stream to\Ncelebrate my new last name when I get home!
